rovision for closed car parking for added convenience. [...] ## Key Features of Ashray Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n## Amenities Ashray Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n### Convenience\n\n### Safety\n\n### Sports\n\n### Leisure\n\n### Environment\n\n### Home Specifications\n\n## Google Map Location of Ashray Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West\n\n## Locality Overview of Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\nKandivali West is a fast-developing residential area in Mumbai, preferred for its open surroundings and improving connectivity. The locality offers access to daily conveniences such as schools, healthcare facilities, and retail options within the broader Kandivali West region.\n\nWith increasing residential development and infrastructure growth, Kandivali West is often considered by buyers looking for affordable housing and long-term value.\n\n## RERA QR codes [...] ## Daily Living Experience Around the Project\n\nDaily life around Ashray Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West, Mumbai is shaped by the well-established residential character of Kandivali. The area generally supports everyday routines such as commuting to work, grocery shopping, school access, and other daily services without requiring long travel distances.\n\nUnlike heavily commercial zones, the surrounding environment largely attracts long-term residents and families. This creates a more predictable and stable residential setting where daily life follows a comfortable pace.\n\nCompared with many homes in Mumbai localities, neighbourhoods like Kandivali West often appeal to buyers who want both city connectivity and a family-friendly residential atmosphere.","score":0.86954874,"raw_content":null,"id":"73db36-02"},{"url":"https://housiey.com/projects/ashray-jaswanti-jewel","title":"Ashray Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West - Housiey","content":"This project offers 17+ amenities. Key external amenities include Mini Theatre, Open Air Cinema, Indoor games, Jacuzzi, and BBQ Lawn. Internal","score":0.8482825,"raw_c