va College, KES International School, Billabong High International School, Ryan International School, Kapol Vidhyanidhi International School, and Witty International School. [...] Ashray Jaswanti Jewel is where every moment is an opportunity to cherish. Imagine waking up to breathtaking city views, where the hustle and bustle of the metropolis fade away into a serene haven of tranquillity. Immerse yourself in a world of leisure and entertainment at the clubhouse and sky-life indulgences, or rejuvenate in the serene Zen garden.\n\nExperience the ultimate convenience and sustainability practices. Indulge in a vibrant community at the cafe with a waiting lounge. At Ashray Jaswanti Jewel, you're not just acquiring a home; you're embracing a lifestyle that seamlessly blends luxury, convenience, and a world of amenities at your fingertips.\n\n## \n\n## Key highlights of Ashray Jaswanti Jewel\n\n1. A Grand Entrance that Sets the Tone [...] ## An Overview of Ashray Jaswanti Jewel\n\nWelcome to Ashray Jaswanti Jewel, a testament to refined elegance and unparalleled luxury offering 2 and 3 BHK units across 2 buildings, totaling 160 units. Indulge in leisure at the clubhouse on the 37th and rooftop levels, featuring a yoga studio, spa, and automated car-parking tower for ultimate convenience.\n\nAs you step into the grand entrance lobby, the epitome of sophistication, the stage is set for an extraordinary living experience.\n\n## \n\n## When will Ashray Jaswanti Jewel be ready for occupancy?\n\nAshray Jaswanti Jewel is expected to be ready for occupancy from December 2027 onwards.\n\n## \n\n## Ashray Jaswanti Jewel: Finely Crafted for You to Live Preciously","score":0.72675586,"raw_content":null,"id":"e6f6cd-07"}],"response_time":4.13,"request_id":"1fefe3e9-38cc-47ae-a4c8-cee25aa7ef62"}